  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6deeca01110b62f428f9ebb535eb63e7, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 518081437696
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518102409216
    m_Localized: 'Tutorial: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518102409217
    m_Localized: Travel to {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518102409218
    m_Localized: Build {0} in {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518102409219
    m_Localized: 'Un-pause the game [Space]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518102409220
    m_Localized: 'Set the game speed to fast [2]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518102409221
    m_Localized: Upgrade your cart to tier II.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518102409222
    m_Localized: Buy {0} {1} in {2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603520
    m_Localized: Sell {0} {1} in {2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603521
    m_Localized: Upgrade {0} to tier II.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603522
    m_Localized: Welcome, Merchant! This is a game about trade.\nYou will help small,
      disconnected towns develop by delivering what they need...\nAnd you'll make
      a pretty coin along the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603523
    m_Localized: In this introduction, you will develop TownA and TownB to tier II.\nTowns
      grow by consuming the goods you sell them, through trade missions and in various
      other ways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603524
    m_Localized: It looks like TownB has an active trade mission for hay right now.
      You are currently in TownA, which happens to produce hay. Buy 15 hay, travel
      to TownB and sell it to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603525
    m_Localized: Well done! Fulfilling missions gives you a cash reward and raises
      the towns development. You can inspect a town's development in the top of the
      town panel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603526
    m_Localized: In the meantime, TownA got ready to be upgraded. To upgrade towns
      to the next tier, you need to fulfill their upgrade missions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603527
    m_Localized: TownA needs berries to upgrade. The forest near TownB has berries.
      Build a berry picker in TownB and buy 30 berries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603528
    m_Localized: Nicely done! Investing in production buildings not only produces
      goods in the town, but also bumps up the towns development and your reputation
      with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603529
    m_Localized: It will take some time to amass the 30 berries needed for TownA's
      upgrade mission. You can wait here and let some days pass by unpausing the
      game via [Space]. To further speed up time, press [2].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603530
    m_Localized: There are now enough berries. Deliver them to TownA to complete
      their upgrade. While you're at it, you should also buy some wild game. The
      more goods a town has bought, the faster they develop. And the better your
      margins!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603531
    m_Localized: To fit more than one good into your caravan, you must first upgrade
      your cart. Upgrading your carts makes them faster and adds more storage space.
      But be aware of increasing upkeep costs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603532
    m_Localized: Good job! TownA has been upgraded to Tier II. It has improved production
      speed and earns more coin, which is great news for you, as they can buy more
      goods off of you at once. Upgrading a town also unlocks the next tier of goods,
      which have much better earning potential for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603533
    m_Localized: It's time to find your own fortune now. With everything you've learned,
      go ahead and help TownB get to tier II.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603534
    m_Localized: TownA has some untapped resources in the neighboring fields. Build
      more production buildings, ship goods back and forth and help TownB prosper.\nGood
      luck out there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603535
    m_Localized: Intro
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603536
    m_Localized: Welcome!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603537
    m_Localized: Thanks for playing Medieval Merchant!\n\nYour goal is to build a
      profitable trade network by buying and selling goods between towns and helping
      them grow over time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603538
    m_Localized: Trading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603539
    m_Localized: You can buy goods that towns produce and sell them to other towns.
      You find your inventory on the left and the towns inventory and production
      buildings on the right of the screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603540
    m_Localized: Prices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603541
    m_Localized: Prices are driven by supply and demand as well as a variety of other
      factors. Make sure to pay attention to current events in the game.\n\nIf you
      want to understand how prices are calculated, you can hover them in the trade
      popup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603542
    m_Localized: Towns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603543
    m_Localized: Each town produces certain goods based on the resources of nearby
      regions. Supplying towns with what they lack helps them grow, unlock better
      production bulidings and trade opportunities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603544
    m_Localized: Caravan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603545
    m_Localized: Carts determine how much you can carry and how fast you travel.
      The better your carts, the more you can carry but the higher is also your upkeep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603546
    m_Localized: Winning and Losing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603547
    m_Localized: To win you need to satisfy all win conditions and manage to not
      trigger any losing condition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603548
    m_Localized: Tutorials
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603549
    m_Localized: If you ever wonder how things work, look out for buttons with question
      marks. They open further tutorials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603550
    m_Localized: Good Luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603551
    m_Localized: That is all for now :)\n\nYou will learn more as you play. Enjoy
      the journey!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603552
    m_Localized: Controls & the World Map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603553
    m_Localized: Camera Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603554
    m_Localized: Move the camera with WASD. Hold the middle mouse button to pan the
      view.\n\n[C] centers the camera on your location.\n\n[Space] pauses the game.
      [1] and [2] set the game speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603555
    m_Localized: Traveling to Towns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603556
    m_Localized: Right-click on a town to move your caravan there. Travel takes time
      and costs upkeep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603557
    m_Localized: Town Details
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603558
    m_Localized: Left-click towns and production zones to inspect their details.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518106603559
    m_Localized: Towns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797824
    m_Localized: General
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797825
    m_Localized: Towns are your way of winning games. You will trade with them, get
      them on your side, complete their missions and help them develop and prosper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797826
    m_Localized: Development
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797827
    m_Localized: Each town has a development gauge that reflects its growth over
      time. Supplying foreign goods, completing missions and building production
      increases the towns development trend.\n\nWith growing development more and
      more development milestones unlock, improving the towns stats and enabling
      further trade opportunities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797828
    m_Localized: Missions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797829
    m_Localized: Towns will occasionally start trade missions where they request
      specific goods. Fulfilling these requests will aid their development. Failing
      to supply requested goods in time will set the town back however.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797830
    m_Localized: Advancing Town Tiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797831
    m_Localized: To help a town advance to the next tier, you must complete its upgrade
      missions. These become available once the town reaches a development of 100.\n\nTowns
      of higher tiers can produce higher tier goods which usually have better margins
      for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797832
    m_Localized: Reputation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797833
    m_Localized: Towns remember how you treat them. Their opinion of you changes
      with each trade and as you help them develop or choose to neglect them.\n\nTrades,
      constuction of buildings, failing or completing missions, among others all
      influence your reputation with towns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797834
    m_Localized: Production Buildings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797835
    m_Localized: You can finance production buildings in towns to make them produce
      goods and raise development.\n\nConstructing producers is essential as they
      add more resources to your trade network and enable you to complete missions,
      react to world events and make profits by supplying the right goods at the
      right time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797836
    m_Localized: Producer Tiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797837
    m_Localized: Tier I buildings can be built based on the towns neighboring regions.\n\nTier
      II buildings are built on top of Tier I buildings.\n\nTier III buildings are
      built on top of a Tier II producer and require a seconds Tier II good to produce
      Tier III goods. This second good can either be produced in the town or must
      be delivered (sold) by you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797838
    m_Localized: Town Development
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797839
    m_Localized: Development
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797840
    m_Localized: Each town has a development gauge that reflects its growth over
      time. Supplying foreign goods, completing missions and financing production
      buildings increases the towns development trend.\n\nWith growing development
      more and more milestones unlock, improving the towns stats and enabling further
      trade opportunities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797841
    m_Localized: Missions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797842
    m_Localized: Towns will occasionally start trade missions, where they specific
      goods.\n\nFulfilling these requests will aid their development. Failing to
      supply these requested goods in time will set the town back however.\n\nChoose
      wisely whom to help and whom to ignore as you will likely not have enough time
      to satisfy everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797843
    m_Localized: Town Tiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797844
    m_Localized: To help a town advance to the next tier, you must fulfill its upgrade
      missions. These become available once the town reaches a development of 100.\n\nTowns
      of higher tiers can produce higher tier goods which have better margins for
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797845
    m_Localized: Town Production
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797846
    m_Localized: Production Buildings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797847
    m_Localized: You can finance production buildings in towns to make them produce
      goods and raise development.\n\nConstructing producers is essential as they
      add more resources to your trade network and enable you to complete missions,
      react to world events and make profits by supplying the right goods at the
      right time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797848
    m_Localized: Production Tiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797849
    m_Localized: Tier I buildings can be built based on the towns neighboring regions.\n\nTier
      II buildings are built on top of Tier I buildings.\n\nTier III buildings are
      built on top of a Tier II producer and require a seconds Tier II good to produce
      Tier III goods. This second good can either be produced in the town or must
      be delivered (sold) by you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797850
    m_Localized: Caravan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797851
    m_Localized: Carts & Upgrades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797852
    m_Localized: As you make more money and expand your trade network you will develop
      the need to move faster and haul more goods.\n\nTo do this, you can upgrade
      your carts or purchase new ones. But be careful! A larger caravan also requires
      more upkeep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797853
    m_Localized: Retinue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797854
    m_Localized: Companions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 518110797855
    m_Localized: You can recruit companions to your retinue. Each companion provides
      unique bonuses which affect your ability to trade, travel and advance in various
      ways.\n\nMake sure to hover your mouse over the various upgrades to see their
      effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
